'''Squid''' is a {{Common}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water.

== Spawning ==
'''Squid''' can be caught on the [[Hub Island]] and most other non-fishing islands. It requires {{Skl|fishing|1}} or higher to be fished up. 

If the player is in the [[The Park]] where the rain bought from {{NPCSprite|Vanessa}} is still active, there's a {{Green|66.6%}} chance to naturally spawn {{Green|1-2}} '''Squids''' every {{Green|11}} seconds when there are less than five squids present that were generated the same way.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Squid''' is {{Green|1,200}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|27.93%|1|3.58|sea creatures}} with all [[Sea Creatures]] unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
